<%- layout('layouts/boiler') %>

<style>
    .imgPicture {
        height: 450px;
    }
    .footer {
        height: 450px;
    }

    .input {
        border: none;
        background: transparent;
    }
    .butter {
        background-color: lime;
    }
</style>

<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto my-12 p-6">
    <div class="flex justify-center space-x-3 items-center">
        <span class="bg-yellow-200 text-yellow-700 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded-full">Trending</span>
        <span class="text-gray-500 text-sm">October 23, 2023</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-semibold mt-6 text-center">Innovative Strategies for <br> Solar Power Utilization</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-600 mt-6 text-center">Maximizing solar power efficiency requires an integrated approach, incorporating advanced technologies, strategic energy planning, and sustainable implementation practices.</p>
    
    <img src="http://localhost:1000/img/solar.jpg" alt="Solar power usage" class="w-full imgPicture object-cover mt-6">
    
    <div class="mt-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Optimizing Solar Energy Consumption</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Enhancing solar energy consumption involves key strategies such as selecting the most suitable solar technologies, effective energy storage solutions, optimizing energy distribution, and employing smart monitoring systems to maximize efficiency.</p>
        
        <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">We provide a holistic approach to optimizing solar power consumption for professionals in the renewable energy sector, covering aspects like selecting the right equipment, implementing smart grid solutions, utilizing advanced solar storage systems, and streamlining energy distribution.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">1. Selecting the Best Solar Technologies</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Choosing the right solar technology is crucial for maximizing energy efficiency. This requires evaluating solar panel efficiency, battery storage capabilities, and compatibility with environmental conditions to ensure optimal performance and sustainability.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">2. Smart Energy Management</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Effective energy management plays a key role in solar power utilization. This includes optimizing energy storage, reducing transmission losses, and implementing AI-driven monitoring systems to enhance efficiency and reduce waste.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">3. Embracing Cutting-Edge Solar Innovations</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Staying ahead with the latest advancements in solar technology ensures better efficiency and reliability. This involves adopting next-generation solar panels, AI-powered energy distribution, and smart inverters that enhance solar energy conversion and utilization.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Related Article</h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <% articles.forEach(article => { %>
            <div class="overflow-hidden">
                <img src="<%= article.image %>" alt="<%= article.title %>" class="w-full h-48 object-cover">
                <div class="mt-4">
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm"><%= article.date %></p>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-2"><%= article.title %></h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-2"><%= article.description %></p>
                </div>
            </div>
        <% }) %>
    </div>

    <div class="text-right mt-6">
        <a href="#" class="text-green-600 font-semibold hover:underline">View all Articles</a>
    </div>
</div>

<div class=" footer relative w-full h-[400px]">
    <img src="https://media.istockphoto.com/id/1414566486/photo/working-at-refinery-oil-production-platform.jpg?b=1&s=612x612&w=0&k=20&c=D-4pc9a8joc3HTQEB84LTAWV87vOhvtUnMUk8FQW__8=" 
        alt="Renewable energy engineers working at night"
        class="object-cover w-full h-full">
    
    <!-- Floating text div -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 flex justify-center flex-col space-y-10 items-center  bg-black bg-opacity-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
       <p class="text-white text-center text-5xl font-semibold">Get involved in the <br> Solar power uprising</p>
       <div class="mt-10 bg-white space-x-3 rounded-full flex flex-row items-center justify-between">
        <input type="text" class="input" placeholder="type your email address">
        <button class="h-full butter w-full bg-lime-600 p-1 px-4 rounded-full font-semibold text-base">Join now <i class="ri-arrow-right-circle-line ml-4 text-xl text-white"></i></button>
       </div>
    </div>
</div>
